{"id":"qd9emk5uu0dzhr0aiic2cjwcv","title":"普林斯顿团队在arXiv发表AI辅助学业指导的局限性研究","originalTitle":"Can AI replace college advisers? Research says not yet","summary":"普林斯顿团队研究显示，AI辅助学业指导在67%的案例中需依赖人类专家不可替代的信息。该研究基于佐治亚州立大学六年的数据，分析8385次学业指导案例，发现人类专家在调整学生课表（因健康问题）、提供数学学习鼓励、建议与职业目标匹配的课程等方面发挥关键作用。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-ai-college.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T22:20:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T01:18:39.209Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T01:18:39.209Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind","OpenAI","NVIDIA"],"score":54,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"504ebabc-7d2b-4750-8613-da8521d68062","title":"普林斯顿研究称AI无法完全替代大学学业指导"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"504ebabc-7d2b-4750-8613-da8521d68062","title":"普林斯顿研究称AI无法完全替代大学学业指导"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fBGegEh2C_2w","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}